# Pairs with TypeOK. A write puts a key outside the declared keyspace in the acknowledged set.
MODULE: WriteAcknowledgesOutOfDomainKey
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the acknowledged-key state escapes the declared domain
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
    /\ acked' = acked \cup {k}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: acknowledge an out-of-domain key.
    /\ acked' = acked \cup {0}
--- END
